      "text": "Problem with design\n1) Consistency = Double booking (same seat booked two times)\n2) Latency = Search service query DB for shows/events/seat etc\n3) Availability = DB can be single point of failure\n4) Scalability = Search can be overloaded due to milion user query DB for show ( celebrity problem)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Problem with design\n1) Consistency = Double booking (same seat booked two times)\n2) Latency = Search service query DB for shows/events/seat etc\n3) Availability = DB can be single point of failure\n4) Scalability = Search can be overloaded due to milion user query DB for show ( celebrity problem)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
